<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 149 0 R
/T (Savannah Space celebrates the vibrancy and beauty of Kenya by curating and creating high quality and unique pieces for the home. We work with multiple artisans around the country to bring to consumers, fun and eclectic furniture and home decor. By supporting Savannah Space, you are consequently fostering economic stability for our various craftsmen and women. Every purchase made has a trickle down effect affecting the lives of our artisans and their families. )
